            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Set your mind free</strong></h2><br>You were kidnapped by aliens and your mind is the only weapon that you can use against them. Solve the puzzle, outsmart your oppressors and save yourself, save the world!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenge your mind! </strong></h2><br>Test your brain sharpness in six different levels. Use your dexterity, concentration, perceptivity and think out of the box to complete'em all!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Real fun - Real tests</strong></h2><br>All of the tests was prepared based on cognitive and rehabilitative clinical trials in cooperation with Medical Doctors.<br>Improve yourself!<br>Raise your skills - compare your scores with the players from the whole world, with your friends and your family. Can you beat them and show the real power of your mind ?",
